{"id":6771039568196,"title":"Drop Vuolle Compact","handle":"drop-vuolle-compact","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSame amount of luxury in a smaller size. Drop Compact Series brings you the perfect combination of luxury and relaxation for smaller spaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWith massage seats for 3, and 24 massage jets, Drop Vuolle Compact brings you the same experience as our flagship models, in a smaller package, but without compromising our signature design and combination of features and adaptability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs with all Drop spas, Drop Vuolle Compact can also be embedded, fully or partially, to fit perfectly into your terrace or patio. Or you can install it on top of your terrace and cover the sides with beautiful paneling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv hidden=\"\" class=\"accordion tablinks active\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"teknisettiedot\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 3-4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *190 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *171 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 900-1200 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 250 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv hidden=\"\" class=\"accordion tablinks active\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eCONTENTS OF THE POOL PACKAGE\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sisalto\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129511\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system: 24 nozzles, massage seats for three\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump 1.5 kW\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe pool technology is assembled and water-tested at the factory.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2023-02-28T11:35:41+01:00","created_at":"2023-02-28T11:35:41+01:00","vendor":"Drop","type":"","tags":["outdoor spa"],"price":1680000,"price_min":1680000,"price_max":1680000,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":null,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":39913691054404,"title":"Black \/ Cold","option1":"Black","option2":"Cold","option3":null,"sku":"301220509","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":29150778130756,"product_id":6771039568196,"position":5,"created_at":"2023-02-28T11: